            1088,
            500
          ],
          "zoom": 1.12,
          "at": "Your browser opens"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-values",
      "narration": "Then copy four values into the credential page: the client ID, the client secret, the refresh token, and the project ID. Never put them in the conversation. On a Mac, your agent gives you a command for each, that copies the value without showing it.",
